Notes on scope.

This license covers the documentation, configuration, and example code in this
repository. The Cloudflare Worker that backs the paid endpoints is maintained
in a separate private working tree and is not distributed under MIT here.

All third-party dependencies used to produce the live service (the `@x402/*`
packages, `@coinbase/cdp-sdk`, `hono`, `jose`, `viem`) are MIT-compatible and
are not redistributed by this repo. Any consumer who self-hosts the worker
inherits each package's own license terms at runtime.

The Coinweb / Coinbase trademarks and the CDP facilitator URL are properties
of their respective owners; their appearance in this repository does not imply
endorsement.
